[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Paseo Hub is in early development: expect breaking changes, and back up
its data directory before each upgrade.

To start Hub, set paseo_hub_enable="YES" and run "service paseo_hub
start".  It listens on 127.0.0.1:3000 (paseo_hub_bind, paseo_hub_port)
and keeps an embedded database in /var/db/paseo-hub (paseo_hub_datadir);
set paseo_hub_env="DATABASE_URL=postgres://..." to use PostgreSQL.

Put Hub behind an HTTPS reverse proxy and set paseo_hub_url to its public
origin.  GitHub and Linear webhooks and Slack's webhook mode need it;
Slack Socket Mode does not.

Open that origin to create the operator account, then connect each Paseo
daemon (misc/paseo) from its machine with "paseo hub login <origin>".
Hub runs agents only with the Claude Code, Codex, and OpenCode providers.
EOM
}
]
